Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:07:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1439/1463] HERESY 1510-1511: the chain as a node and wires
 drawn by hand making a node's newest branch another's source; the DAW's waves
 whole at one height, nothing growing under the pointer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
